                <pb facs="0354" n="332" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v01/pg332"/>

                <head>151. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>The Central Intelligence Agency prepared a Special National Intelligence
                    Estimate, SNIE 10-3-61, “Probable Communist Reactions to Certain SEATO
                    Undertakings in South Vietnam.” The text of this paper is printed in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States-Vietnam Relations, 1945-1967</hi>, Book
                    11, pages 313-321; although no copy has been found. The printed text does not
                    include the usual cover sheet indicating that the estimate was approved by the
                    appropriate intelligence agencies.</p>
            </div>
